{{also|Appendix:Variations of "?"}}
==Translingual==
===Etymology===
? may derive from Qo, with the Q written over the o, an abbreviation of Latin {{term|quaestio||question}}, placed at the end of a question to mark it as such.<ref>Alexander Humez, 1987, ''A B C et cetera: the life & times of the Roman alphabet''</ref>

